@TraceX.Samples.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5238

### Trigger Null Reference Exception
GET {{TraceX.Samples.Api_HostAddress}}/api/null-reference
Accept: application/json

### Trigger HTTP Dependency Exception
GET {{TraceX.Samples.Api_HostAddress}}/api/http-dependency
Accept: application/json

### Trigger Background Worker Exception
GET {{TraceX.Samples.Api_HostAddress}}/api/background-worker
Accept: application/json

